l, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6024.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Every 1 kg of the product will contain 3pcs-4pcs of Guava.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6024.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6024.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-4\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Guava is a tropical fruit rich in high-profile nutrients. Thai guavas are generally the size of a softball with apple green skin that can range from bumpy to smooth. The flesh is white with pale yellow seeds and tends to be drier than the pink type of guavas.&nbsp;</p>', 'en', '2023-03-12 23:59:54', '2023-03-12 23:59:54', NULL);
