ith complete hygiene rules.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p38375.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-17\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">6. Fish are caught and processed on the same day.</p>', 'en', '2023-03-13 03:07:01', '2023-03-13 23:17:28', NULL);
