3686.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Source: CULTURED</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p13686.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p13686.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-4\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Butterfish or pabda fish is a type of catfish. It is a freshwater fish that can be found primarily in India and Bangladesh. It has a flavorful taste and a definite texture.In Khulna &amp; Jessore area best quality Pabda fish is available.</p>', 'hi', '2023-03-15 13:35:32', '2023-03-15 13:35:32', NULL);
