x better cleaning and germ kill than phenyl &amp; detergents. It kills virus and 99.9% germs, removes tough stains from surfaces &amp; leaves your home with pleasant fragrance. Lizol is safe to use on all surfaces like Ceramic, Marble Granite, Mosaic.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p5683.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Usage Information:</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p5683.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-8\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Mix 1 cap Lizol with water (half bucket) for cleaning home &amp; bathroom surfaces. For kitchen, use Lizol directly without diluting with water.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p5683.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-9\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Safety Measure: Do not mix with other cleaner or acid. Wash your hands properly after using Lizol. This product is not edible and harmful for eyes and skin. Read label for detail.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p5683.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-10\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">About the Manufacturer: Lizol &amp; Lysol are brands of Reckitt Benckiser Group PLC. Lizol products are manufactured and marketed in Bangladesh by Reckitt Benckiser Bangladesh Limited</p>', 0, 100, 100, 10, 'percent', 1678665600, 1745971200, 100, 241, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 12, 72, 24, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 100, '2023-03-13 05:01:51', '2023-11-19 00:10:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0);
