ial formula for indoor cats contains delicate chicken with chicken liver for indoor cats. Its herbal essences give urinary comfort to your cat. It\'s rich in chicken protein that cats love and crave. Vitamins, minerals, and probiotics are in this food to improve your cat\'s teeth, skeleton, and immunity. Chicken liver gravy discerns felines.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Composition:</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-4\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">dried chicken 38% (chicken meat meal 20%, chicken dried 18%), rice, chicken fat (preserved with tocopherols), corn, dried beet pulp, dried apples, brewer’s yeast, chicken liver gravy 4%, salmon oil 1%, dried dandelion 0,25%, prebiotics (mannan-oligosaccharides 140 mg/kg, fructooligosaccharides 110 mg/kg), yucca schidigera extract (75 mg/kg), fruit and herbal extract (rosemary, cloves, citrus, curcuma, 55 mg/kg).</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-5\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Analytical ingredients:</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-6\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">crude protein 29.0%, fat content 14.0%, crude fiber 5.5%, crude ash 6.0%, moisture 10.0%, calcium 1.2%, phosphorus 1.0%, sodium 0.3%, magnesium 0.08%.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Nutritional composition:</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-8\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">vitamin A (E672) 20,000 I.U., vitamin D3 (E671) 800 I.U., vitamin E (3a700) 500 mg, vitamin C (E300) 200 mg, taurine 2,000 mg, choline chloride 1,800 mg, L-carnitine 50 mg, niacin 35 mg, biotin 1.5 mg, zinc (E6) 130 mg, manganese (E5) 50 mg, iron (E1) 40 mg, copper (E4) 10 mg, iodine (E2) 3.2 mg, selenium (E8) 0.2 mg, DLmethionine (3c301) 12 mg, arginine (3c3.6.1) 9 mg, L-lysine (3.2.3.) 8 mg.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-9\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Metabolizable energy:</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-10\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">3,650 kcal/kg. Omega-3: 0.22%, Omega-6: 1.7%.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-11\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-12\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Manufacturer: Brit -VAFO PRAHA</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p16053.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-13\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Quantity: 800 gm</p>', 0, 250, 250, 0, 'percent', NULL, NULL, 50, 191, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 12, 72, 24, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 250, '2023-03-13 05:03:34', '2025-05-12 16:28:51', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `shop_id`, `added_by`, `name`, `slug`, `brand_id`, `unit_id`, `thumbnail_image`, `gallery_images`, `product_tags`, `short_description`, `description`, `price`, `min_price`, `max_price`, `discount_value`, `discount_type`, `discount_start_date`, `discount_end_date`, `sell_target`, `stock_qty`, `is_published`, `is_featured`, `min_purchase_qty`, `max_purchase_qty`, `has_variation`, `has_warranty`, `total_sale_count`, `standard_delivery_hours`, `express_delivery_hours`, `size_guide`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_img`, `reward_points`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `vedio_link`, `created_by`, `updated_by`, `is_import`) VALUES (35, 1, 'admin', 'Rambutan Sweet Delicious Fruit', 'rambutan-sweet-delicious-fruit-5p0o9', 4, 2, 76, '76,77,83,81', NULL, '500~600gm\r\n\r\nPomegranate fruit is one of the most popular, nutritionally rich fruit with unique flavor, taste, and health promoting characteristics. The fruit is moderate in calories, holds about 83 calories per 100 grams; slightly more than that of in the apples. It contains no cholesterol or saturated fats. It is a good source of soluble and insoluble dietary fibers;', '<p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6012.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">500~600gm</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6012.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6012.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Pomegranate fruit is one of the most popular, nutritionally rich fruit with unique flavor, taste, and health promoting characteristics. The fruit is moderate in calories, holds about 83 calories per 100 grams; slightly more than that of in the apples. It contains no cholesterol or saturated fats. It is a good source of soluble and insoluble dietary fibers; providing about 4 grams per 100 g (about 12% of RDA). Dietary fiber aid in smooth digestion and bowel movements. The fruit is an also good source of antioxidant vitamin-C, provides about 17% per 100 g of daily requirement. Consumption of fruits rich in vitamin C helps the body develop resistance against infectious agents by boosting immunity. Pomegranate seeds make an attractive garnish on salads and dishes and fresh fruits make fantastic refreshing juice. Pomegranate juice can be employed to prepare soups, jellies, sorbets, sauces as well as to flavor cakes, baked apples and other desserts.</p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6012.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p data-reactid=\".2e891giyf5c.b.2.0.0.0.0.2.5.1.0:$p6012.0.6.0.1.0.1.4.$line-4\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;droid sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;\">Minimum Weight: 500-600 gm</p>', 0, 300, 300, 0, 'percent', NULL, NULL, 250, 226, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 30, 72, 24, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 250, '2023-03-13 05:08:08', '2025-05-16 10:59:15', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0);
